    {
      "name": "skills-360",
      "title": {
        "en": "Skills 360 — skill health check",
        "zh": "技能体检 360"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A six-dimension health check for every skill in the Harness catalog, with a sidebar panel and four skills360_* tools. It scores the on-demand loading path (catalog selectability, whether the skill was actually loaded on demand, trigger uniqueness, idle catalog cost), progressive disclosure (entry size, deferred references, and a reference index), actionability, boundary/governance, maintenance hygiene, and continuous evolution: post-load corrections, tool errors, re-loads, asks and failed turns are mined into evidence-backed lesson proposals, written to references/lessons.md and linked into the body so the next load reads them on demand. Every write is backed up and undoable; signals are read locally and never leave the machine.",
        "zh": "给 Harness catalog 里的每个技能做六维体检，带侧栏面板与四个 skills360_* 工具。它评的是按需加载路径（目录可选中性、真实会话里是否被按需加载、触发唯一性、空闲目录成本）、渐进披露（入口体积、细节外置、按需索引）、可执行性、边界与治理、维护卫生，以及持续进化：加载后的纠错、工具报错、重复加载、追问与失败回合会被挖成带证据的经验提案，写入 references/lessons.md 并接进入口，下一次加载即可按需读到。所有写入都有备份、可撤销；信号只在本机读取，不出机器。"
      },
